r.inl h\n  · rintro (h | h)\n    · exact Or.inr h\n    · exact Or.inl (by simpa using h)\n\ndef ShapeKnotsNullSpace : Prop :=\n  ∀ (P : ShapeParams) (D : TimeFieldData), IsShapeParams P →\n    volume {y : Space | KnotZero.planeOf y ∈ mirrorKnots P D} = 0\n\nend GivenShape\n\nend CertCell\n\nend Breakdown\n"}